WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:20.732
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:24.010
I'm a porcupine.

3
00:00:24.011 --> 00:00:28.144
Porcupines are large rodents.

4
00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:33.274
Rodents have sharp front teeth.

5
00:00:33.275 --> 00:00:36.400
Where do you live?

6
00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:41.805
Porcupines live all over the world.

7
00:00:41.806 --> 00:00:46.205
Some like forests or caves.

8
00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:51.767
We live in snowbanks and the desert too.

9
00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:55.002
What do you eat?

10
00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:59.121
Many porcupines like bark.

11
00:00:59.122 --> 00:01:05.023
We bite it with our big teeth.

12
00:01:05.024 --> 00:01:09.568
We also like grass and fruit.

13
00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:15.577
You have needles on your fur!

14
00:01:15.578 --> 00:01:18.846
Those are my quills.

15
00:01:18.847 --> 00:01:25.538
They are very sharp!

16
00:01:25.539 --> 00:01:29.291
Why do you have quills?

17
00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:33.333
Our quills protect us.

18
00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:38.458
They lie flat unless an enemy comes near.

19
00:01:38.459 --> 00:01:43.411
Then our quills pop up!

20
00:01:43.412 --> 00:01:47.104
What do the quills do then?

21
00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:51.525
They can stick into enemies' skin.

22
00:01:51.526 --> 00:01:56.347
They are very hard to get out.

23
00:01:56.348 --> 00:02:00.134
And they hurt!

24
00:02:00.135 --> 00:02:03.476
Can you climb trees?

25
00:02:03.477 --> 00:02:08.764
Many porcupines are good climbers.

26
00:02:08.765 --> 00:02:16.468
But others stay on the ground.

27
00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:21.229
I see some grass.

28
00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:26.370
It's time to eat.

29
00:02:26.371 --> 00:02:33.701
See you later, Porcupine!
